GRAPH <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Architecture> {
  <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Architecture> a narr:Digest ;
    narr:digestOf <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Architecture> ;
    narr:childCount "6"^^xsd:integer ;
    narr:generatedFrom "fd0a5fe1b26d0429410927c8b7e993127fb5d423" ;
    narr:narration """The current architectural posture centers on the implementation of [mandatory deployment gates](narr:DeploymentGateAsIncidentResponse) for the Meridian project, framed as a direct response to previous operational failures involving unsigned artifacts. The deployment control is characterized by [authoritative declarations](narr:GateScopeAndOwnershipAsAuthority) regarding both its jurisdictional reach and internal accountability. As of July 2026, the requirement for a [signed release manifest](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1) is absolute, with the [scope of enforcement](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3) explicitly extending across both staging and production environments. Responsibility for this control is [formally assigned](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4) to Quinton Fairweather, who maintains that the gate is the structural remedy for past security lapses. The discourse surrounding these controls is split between a plain-spoken, incident-driven justification and a more technical, matter-of-fact codification of operational policy.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#DeploymentGateAsIncidentResponse> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#GateScopeAndOwnershipAsAuthority> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Every Meridian deployment now requires a signed release manifest before it ships." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Gate**: signed release manifest required for Meridian deploys" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Scope**: applies to staging and production" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Owner**: Quinton Fairweather" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The tension lies between the reactive, incident-based framing of the gate and its presentation as a static, settled administrative fact." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#DeploymentGateAsIncidentResponse> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#GateScopeAndOwnershipAsAuthority> ] ;
    narr:writer "google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite" .
}